            CommodityClassification.Equilibrium.Example.model.ProductionFeasible i z x →
              CommodityClassification.Equilibrium.Example.model.p i * z -
                  CommodityClassification.Equilibrium.Example.model.frame.w ⬝ᵥ x ≤
                0) ∧
          CommodityClassification.Equilibrium.Example.model.p i *
                CommodityClassification.Equilibrium.Example.model.q i -
