info: LeanMath/CommodityClassification/CheckAllManuscript.lean:7358:0: @CommodityClassification.Robust.combined_coefficient_error : ∀ {n k : ℕ}
  (E E0 : CommodityClassification.Equilibrium.Model n k) (δ τ : ℝ),
  0 ≤ δ →
    δ ≤ 1 →
      0 ≤ τ →
        E.C = E0.C →
          E.substitutionMatrix = E0.substitutionMatrix →
            Matrix.PosDef E.D →
              Matrix.PosDef E0.D →
                Matrix.PosDef E.K →
                  Matrix.PosDef E0.K →
                    Matrix.PosSemidef E0.substitutionMatrix →
                      Matrix.PosSemidef (E.D - (1 - δ) • E0.D) →
                        Matrix.PosSemidef ((1 + δ) • E0.D - E.D) →
                          (E.b - E0.b) ⬝ᵥ Matrix.mulVec E0.D (E.b - E0.b) ≤ τ ^ 2 * E0.b ⬝ᵥ Matrix.mulVec E0.D E0.b →
                            |E.lossCoefficient - E0.lossCoefficient| ≤
                              CommodityClassification.Robust.errorConstant δ τ * E0.b ⬝ᵥ Matrix.mulVec E0.D E0.b
info: LeanMath/CommodityClassification/CheckAllManuscript.lean:7359:0: 'CommodityClassification.Robust.combined_coefficient_error' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
